<title>BELGIUM: Belgian company investment fell 2.0 pct in Feb.</title>
<headline>Belgian company investment fell 2.0 pct in Feb.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgium's National Statistics Office released the following data on corporate investment, calculated from VAT returns, for February 1997 -</p>
<p>    COMPANY INVESTMENT     Feb 1997   Jan 1997  Feb 1996</p>
<p>    Index (base 100=1985)  150.3	152.4     153.3</p>
<p>    Yr/yr pct change	 2.0	  2.3</p>
<p>    COMPANY INVESTMENT     Jan-Feb 1997	Jan-Feb 1996</p>
<p>    Yr/yr pct change	-0.6		   0.1</p>
<p>NOTE - non-industrial investments fell 1.4 percent in the first two months, industrial investments fell 0.1 percent.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
